thirteen thousand, five hundred,

283
00:10:35,765 --> 00:10:38,187
and the lowest is eight thousand,

284
00:10:38,187 --> 00:10:39,582
one hundred thirty.

285
00:10:39,762 --> 00:10:42,068
That is a gap of five thousand,

286
00:10:42,068 --> 00:10:44,226
three hundred seventy pounds,

