00:10:44,226 --> 00:10:46,756
and all of those trucks are called

288
00:10:46,756 --> 00:10:50,327
half-ton pickups, from the three biggest brands.

289
00:10:50,507 --> 00:10:52,872
If a friend says a half-ton truck

290
00:10:52,872 --> 00:10:55,237
