00:11:10,135 --> 00:11:13,270
eight hundred pounds below the best Ford.

298
00:11:13,450 --> 00:11:15,806
The Tacoma, at six thousand,

299
00:11:15,806 --> 00:11:19,592
five hundred, is seven thousand pounds below.

300
00:11:19,772 --> 00:11:22,216
But the Colorado is within about five

301
00:11:22,216 --> 00:11:24,462
hundred pounds of the Ram with the

302
00:11:24,462 --> 00:11:26,841
Pentastar engine, at eight thousand,

303
00:11:26,841 --> 00:11:28,096
one hundred thirty.

304
00:11:28,276 --> 00:11:31,349
A basic full-size truck and a strong

305
00:11:31,349 --> 00:11:34,849
midsize truck are closer than their sizes

306
00:11:34,849 --> 00:11:35,532
suggest.

307
00:11:35,882 --> 00:11:38,265
This is useful for a buyer who

308
00:11:38,265 --> 00:11:41,601
is choosing between a base full-size truck

309
00:11:41,601 --> 00:11:44,381
and a midsize truck with a stronger

310
00:11:44,381 --> 00:11:44,937
engine.

311
00:11:45,117 --> 00:11:47,746
The base full-size truck may have a

312
00:11:47,746 --> 00:11:50,075
bigger bed, and a bigger cabin.

313
00:11:50,255 --> 00:11:52,602
But if the goal is only towing,

314
00:11:52,602 --> 00:11:55,253
the midsize truck might do the same

315
00:11:55,253 --> 00:11:57,070
work, for a lower price.

316
00:11:57,250 --> 00:12:00,362
The Colorado starts at thirty-two thousand,

317
00:12:00,362 --> 00:12:01,882
four hundred dollars,

318
00:12:01,882 --> 00:12:04,849
and the Silverado at thirty-six thousand,

319
00:12:04,849 --> 00:12:07,455
nine hundred, according to Autoblog.

320
00:12:07,635 --> 00:12:09,991
That is a difference of four thousand,

321
00:12:09,991 --> 00:12:11,292
five hundred dollars.

322
00:12:11,643 --> 00:12:14,034
And here is the opposite case.

323
00:12:14,214 --> 00:12:17,112
A buyer who tows a heavy trailer,

324
00:12:17,112 --> 00:12:19,659
close to ten thousand pounds,

325
00:12:19,659 --> 00:12:22,645
should not buy a base half-ton and

326
00:12:22,645 --> 00:12:23,084
hope.

327
00:12:23,264 --> 00:12:25,379
They should look at the engine and

328
00:12:25,379 --> 00:12:27,742
the package, because that is where the

329
00:12:27,742 --> 00:12:28,675
numbers change.

330
00:12:28,855 --> 00:12:30,819
The Silverado, for example,

331
00:12:30,819 --> 00:12:33,803
goes from about nine thousand to thirteen

332
00:12:33,803 --> 00:12:37,005
thousand, three hundred with the package and

333
00:12:37,005 --> 00:12:37,806
the diesel.

334
00:12:37,986 --> 00:12:41,109
Spending more on the right configuration can

335
00:12:41,109 --> 00:12:43,522
be the cheapest way to stay inside

336
00:12:43,522 --> 00:12:44,232
the limit.

337
00:12:44,582 --> 00:12:47,064
Here is how to use these numbers

338
00:12:47,064 --> 00:12:47,995
in practice.

339
00:12:48,175 --> 00:12:50,246
Autoblog's advice is simple,

340
00:12:50,246 --> 00:12:52,169
and it is worth repeating.

341
00:12:52,349 --> 00:12:54,760
Check the door sticker on your specific

342
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:57,109
truck, and know your trailer's weight.

343
00:12:57,289 --> 00:12:59,668
Do not use the brochure number for

344
00:12:59,668 --> 00:13:02,186
your truck, use the sticker for your

345
00:13:02,186 --> 00:13:02,606
truck.

346
00:13:02,786 --> 00:13:05,776
And do not use the trailer's advertised

347
00:13:05,776 --> 00:13:08,382
weight, use what it weighs when it

348
00:13:08,382 --> 00:13:09,148
is loaded.

349
00:13:09,328 --> 00:13:11,576
These three checks take ten minutes,

350
00:13:11,576 --> 00:13:14,135
and they prevent the most common mistake.

351
00:13:14,485 --> 00:13:16,075
Then think about the margin.

352
00:13:16,255 --> 00:13:18,439
A trailer that is close to the

353
00:13:18,439 --> 00:13:20,404
limit of a truck is hard on

354
00:13:20,404 --> 00:13:22,224
the truck, on the brakes,

355
00:13:22,224 --> 00:13:23,535
and on the driver.

356
00:13:23,715 --> 00:13:26,515
Buying a truck with some extra capacity

357
00:13:26,515 --> 00:13:29,458
is cheaper than replacing a transmission,

358
00:13:29,458 --> 00:13:31,900
and much cheaper than an accident.

359
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:34,657
We cannot give you a safe percentage,

360
00:13:34,657 --> 00:13:37,095
because the sources we used do not,

361
00:13:37,095 --> 00:13:39,185
and it depends on the trailer,

362
00:13:39,185 --> 00:13:40,857
the road and the driver.

363
00:13:41,037 --> 00:13:42,407
But we can say this.

364
00:13:42,587 --> 00:13:44,728
Never buy a truck for a number

365
00:13:44,728 --> 00:13:46,940
that you will use at its limit,

366
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:47,939
every weekend.

367
00:13:48,289 --> 00:13:49,358
One more point,

368
00:13:49,358 --> 00:13:51,853
because it connects with the price.

369
00:13:52,033 --> 00:13:55,509
The Silverado's Max Trailering package is an

370
00:13:55,509 --> 00:13:58,433
option, and the truck without it tows

371
00:13:58,433 --> 00:14:00,961
about four thousand pounds less.

372
00:14:01,141 --> 00:14:02,841
That option costs money,

373
00:14:02,841 --> 00:14:04,966
and the sources we used do not

374
00:14:04,966 --> 00:14:06,029
list its price.

375
00:14:06,209 --> 00:14:07,834
So ask the dealer.

376
00:14:08,014 --> 00:14:10,245
A buyer who needs to tow nine

377
00:14:10,245 --> 00:14:13,475
thousand pounds, and buys the version that

378
00:14:13,475 --> 00:14:14,937
tows nine thousand,

379
00:14:14,937 --> 00:14:16,013
has no margin.

380
00:14:16,193 --> 00:14:18,448
A buyer who spends more on the

381
00:14:18,448 --> 00:14:20,477
package may have much more.

382
00:14:20,828 --> 00:14:23,405
Finally, remember the new trucks.

383
00:14:23,585 --> 00:14:26,610
The Ram one thousand five hundred REV,

384
00:14:26,610 --> 00:14:30,989
the range-extended truck coming in twenty twenty-seven,

385
00:14:30,989 --> 00:14:33,934
has no published towing capacity yet,

386
00:14:33,934 --> 00:14:35,845
according to TruckDaily.

387
00:14:36,025 --> 00:14:39,390
The Lightning will return as an extended-range

388
00:14:39,390 --> 00:14:42,170
truck, but Ford has not announced when

389
00:14:42,170 --> 00:14:43,560
it will go on sale.

390
00:14:43,740 --> 00:14:46,039
And the Slate truck has no towing

391
00:14:46,039 --> 00:14:48,198
figure in the sources we found.

392
00:14:48,378 --> 00:14:50,832
If towing is your reason for buying,

393
00:14:50,832 --> 00:14:52,672
do not buy a truck that has

394
00:14:52,672 --> 00:14:53,626
no number yet.

395
00:14:53,976 --> 00:14:56,001
Let's slow down on one idea,

396
00:14:56,001 --> 00:14:58,244
because it is the heart of this

397
00:14:58,244 --> 00:14:58,678
video.

398
00:14:58,858 --> 00:15:01,080
A towing number is not a property

399
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,224
of a truck model.

400
00:15:02,404 --> 00:15:04,502
It is a property of one exact

401
00:15:04,502 --> 00:15:04,935
build.

402
00:15:05,115 --> 00:15:08,144
When Ford says thirteen thousand,

403
00:15:08,144 --> 00:15:09,980
five hundred pounds,

404
00:15:09,980 --> 00:15:11,540
it means a V six,

405
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:12,917
a Max Tow axle,

406
00:15:12,917 --> 00:15:14,386
a SuperCrew cab,

407
00:15:14,386 --> 00:15:16,680
a six and a half foot box

408
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:18,608
and four-wheel drive,

409
00:15:18,608 --> 00:15:19,709
all at once.

410
00:15:19,889 --> 00:15:21,750
Take away any one of those,

411
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:24,301
and the number is no longer promised.

412
00:15:24,481 --> 00:15:26,446
So when you read a brochure,

413
00:15:26,446 --> 00:15:28,901
read the small print before the big

414
00:15:28,901 --> 00:15:29,322
print.

415
00:15:29,673 --> 00:15:32,490
Here is a simple way to compare

416
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:34,943
two figures we already saw.

417
00:15:35,123 --> 00:15:37,834
The Silverado with the diesel and the

418
00:15:37,834 --> 00:15:40,105
package tows thirteen thousand,

419
00:15:40,105 --> 00:15:41,643
three hundred pounds,

420
00:15:41,643 --> 00:15:44,354
and without the package it tows about

421
00:15:44,354 --> 00:15:46,625
nine thousand to nine thousand,

422
00:15:46,625 --> 00:15:47,651
seven hundred.

423
00:15:47,831 --> 00:15:50,695
The Ram with the Hurricane engine tows

424
00:15:50,695 --> 00:15:53,183
eleven thousand, six hundred ten.

425
00:15:53,363 --> 00:15:56,156
So a basic Silverado can tow less

426
00:15:56,156 --> 00:15:57,087
than a Ram,

427
00:15:57,087 --> 00:16:00,219
and a well equipped Silverado can tow

428
00:16:00,219 --> 00:16:00,642
more.

429
00:16:00,822 --> 00:16:02,680
The badge did not change.

430
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:04,787
The checklist of options did.

431
00:16:05,138 --> 00:16:07,486
Now let's talk about the most common

432
00:16:07,486 --> 00:16:08,400
buyer mistake.

433
00:16:08,580 --> 00:16:10,736
A person sees a number in an

434
00:16:10,736 --> 00:16:13,123
advertisement, goes to the lot,

435
00:16:13,123 --> 00:16:15,894
and buys the truck that looks right.

436
00:16:16,074 --> 00:16:19,172
Nobody checks whether that exact truck has

437
00:16:19,172 --> 00:16:20,056
the package.

438
00:16:20,236 --> 00:16:21,327
Later, at home,

439
00:16:21,327 --> 00:16:24,163
the trailer is heavier than the sticker

440
00:16:24,163 --> 00:16:24,671
allows.

441
00:16:24,851 --> 00:16:27,115
The fix is easy and free.

442
00:16:27,295 --> 00:16:28,530
Before you sign,

443
00:16:28,530 --> 00:16:31,231
ask the salesperson to show you the

444
00:16:31,231 --> 00:16:33,701
door sticker on the exact truck,

445
00:16:33,701 --> 00:16:36,170
and ask for the towing figure in

446
00:16:36,170 --> 00:16:38,640
writing, on the same page as the

447
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,103
price.

448
00:16:39,453 --> 00:16:41,651
A second mistake is to look only

449
00:16:41,651 --> 00:16:43,849
at the tow rating and forget the

450
00:16:43,849 --> 00:16:44,398
payload.

451
00:16:44,578 --> 00:16:45,967
Remember the Ford,

452
00:16:45,967 --> 00:16:48,358
with a payload of two thousand,

453
00:16:48,358 --> 00:16:50,363
four hundred forty pounds,

454
00:16:50,363 --> 00:16:51,751
and the Chevrolet,

455
00:16:51,751 --> 00:16:53,140
with two thousand,

456
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:54,528
two hundred sixty.

457
00:16:54,708 --> 00:16:56,856
The Ram is at two thousand,

458
00:16:56,856 --> 00:16:58,447
three hundred sixty.

459
00:16:58,627 --> 00:17:00,512
These are close to each other,

460
00:17:00,512 --> 00:17:02,586
while the towing numbers are not.

461
00:17:02,766 --> 00:17:04,494
So if you carry people,

462
00:17:04,494 --> 00:17:06,147
tools or a loaded bed,

463
00:17:06,147 --> 00:17:08,702
the payload may be the number that

464
00:17:08,702 --> 00:17:09,979
limits you first,

465
00:17:09,979 --> 00:17:12,158
long before the trailer does.

466
00:17:12,508 --> 00:17:14,667
So who is each truck for?

467
00:17:14,847 --> 00:17:16,985
A buyer who tows close to the

468
00:17:16,985 --> 00:17:18,239
top of the range,

469
00:17:18,239 --> 00:17:20,672
with a heavy trailer every month,

470
00:17:20,672 --> 00:17:23,031
should look at the Ford with the

471
00:17:23,031 --> 00:17:25,390
V six, or the Silverado with the

472
00:17:25,390 --> 00:17:28,118
package, and should pay for the right

473
00:17:28,118 --> 00:17:29,151
configuration.

474
00:17:29,331 --> 00:17:32,091
A buyer who tows a small trailer

475
00:17:32,091 --> 00:17:34,421
a few times a year can save

476
00:17:34,421 --> 00:17:36,578
money with the Ram V six,

477
00:17:36,578 --> 00:17:39,339
or with a midsize truck like the

478
00:17:39,339 --> 00:17:42,531
Colorado, the Frontier or the Tacoma.

479
00:17:42,711 --> 00:17:44,935
And a buyer who only hauls light

480
00:17:44,935 --> 00:17:47,506
loads may be happy with the Maverick.

481
00:17:47,856 --> 00:17:49,202
And who should wait?

482
00:17:49,382 --> 00:17:51,699
Anyone who is planning to tow with

483
00:17:51,699 --> 00:17:53,743
one of the new trucks that has

484
00:17:53,743 --> 00:17:55,106
no published number.

485
00:17:55,286 --> 00:17:56,097
The Ram REV,

486
00:17:56,097 --> 00:17:58,394
the Lightning that is coming back,

487
00:17:58,394 --> 00:18:00,420
and the Slate all fall in this

488
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:03,123
group, according to the sources we used.

489
00:18:03,303 --> 00:18:05,149
You cannot plan a trip with a

490
00:18:05,149 --> 00:18:06,867
number that does not exist.

491
00:18:07,047 --> 00:18:08,865
If you must buy this year,

492
00:18:08,865 --> 00:18:10,823
buy a truck with a figure on

493
00:18:10,823 --> 00:18:13,340
paper, then check it on the sticker.

494
00:18:13,520 --> 00:18:15,385
When the new numbers arrive,

495
00:18:15,385 --> 00:18:17,517
compare them the same way we did

496
00:18:17,517 --> 00:18:17,850
here.

497
00:18:18,201 --> 00:18:20,723
One more way to use the spread

498
00:18:20,723 --> 00:18:21,312
we saw.

499
00:18:21,492 --> 00:18:23,780
The gap between the best Ford at

500
00:18:23,780 --> 00:18:26,926
thirteen thousand, five hundred and the Ford

501
00:18:26,926 --> 00:18:28,786
hybrid at eleven thousand,

502
00:18:28,786 --> 00:18:30,788
two hundred is two thousand,

503
00:18:30,788 --> 00:18:32,289
three hundred pounds.

504
00:18:32,469 --> 00:18:35,135
Ask yourself whether your trailer needs that

505
00:18:35,135 --> 00:18:35,801
extra room.

506
00:18:35,981 --> 00:18:37,181
If it does not,

507
00:18:37,181 --> 00:18:39,500
the hybrid or the V eight may

508
00:18:39,500 --> 00:18:41,020
be the smarter buy.

509
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,923
If your trailer is heavy,

510
00:18:42,923 --> 00:18:44,233
those two thousand,

511
00:18:44,233 --> 00:18:47,059
three hundred pounds are exactly what you

512
00:18:47,059 --> 00:18:49,195
are paying the extra money for,

513
00:18:49,195 --> 00:18:51,125
so do not trade them away to

514
00:18:51,125 --> 00:18:52,090
save a little.

515
00:18:52,441 --> 00:18:55,703
Finally, a note about reading reviews.

516
00:18:55,883 --> 00:18:59,113
When two outlets give two different numbers,

517
00:18:59,113 --> 00:19:01,388
as with the Santa Cruz at three

518
00:19:01,388 --> 00:19:04,911
thousand, five hundred and five thousand pounds,

519
00:19:04,911 --> 00:19:07,040
do not pick the one you like.

520
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,412
Write down both,

521
00:19:08,412 --> 00:19:10,945
and ask the dealer which engine is

522
00:19:10,945 --> 00:19:13,180
in the exact truck in front of

523
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:13,478
you.

524
00:19:13,658 --> 00:19:16,160
If the dealer cannot answer from the

525
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:18,454
sticker, that is a signal to slow

526
00:19:18,454 --> 00:19:18,801
down.

527
00:19:18,981 --> 00:19:21,013
A good answer is specific.

528
00:19:21,193 --> 00:19:23,304
A vague answer is a reason to

529
00:19:23,304 --> 00:19:26,144
keep shopping, and to check another lot

530
00:19:26,144 --> 00:19:27,091
the same day.

531
00:19:27,271 --> 00:19:29,887
Comparing two trucks on the same day

532
00:19:29,887 --> 00:19:32,575
keeps the details fresh in your mind,

533
00:19:32,575 --> 00:19:35,555
and it makes the real differences between

534
00:19:35,555 --> 00:19:37,371
the trucks easier to see.

535
00:19:37,722 --> 00:19:39,667
So what should you check before you

536
00:19:39,667 --> 00:19:41,446
buy a truck for towing in twenty

537
00:19:41,446 --> 00:19:42,168
twenty-seven?

538
00:19:42,348 --> 00:19:43,947
First, the engine,

539
00:19:43,947 --> 00:19:45,990
cab, drive and package,

540
00:19:45,990 --> 00:19:47,677
not only the model.

541
00:19:47,857 --> 00:19:50,279
Second, the door sticker of the exact

542
00:19:50,279 --> 00:19:51,654
truck you are buying.

543
00:19:51,834 --> 00:19:54,597
Third, the loaded weight of your trailer.

544
00:19:54,777 --> 00:19:56,542
And fourth, the payload,

545
00:19:56,542 --> 00:19:59,264
because the tongue of the trailer and

546
00:19:59,264 --> 00:20:01,986
the people in the truck count against

547
00:20:01,986 --> 00:20:02,207
it.

548
00:20:02,387 --> 00:20:04,511
If one of those four is wrong,

549
00:20:04,511 --> 00:20:07,131
the brochure number does not apply to

550
00:20:07,131 --> 00:20:07,414
you.

551
00:20:07,765 --> 00:20:09,535
We put all of this into a

552
00:20:09,535 --> 00:20:13,430
checklist, the Twenty Twenty-Seven Truck Buyer's Guide.

553
00:20:13,610 --> 00:20:15,666
It covers the numbers to check,

554
00:20:15,666 --> 00:20:17,656
the questions to ask a dealer,

555
00:20:17,656 --> 00:20:20,309
and the warning signs we walked through.

556
00:20:20,489 --> 00:20:22,858
The link is in the description and

557
00:20:22,858 --> 00:20:24,390
in the pinned comment.

